OL,4,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,5,     GCraig spins some joyous tunes to
OL,6,     Gget your weekend started, before
OL,7,     Ggiving YOU the chance to pick the
OL,8,     Glast song of the show!
OL,9,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,10,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,11,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,12,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,13,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,14,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,15,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,16,     FKoleoso
OL,17,     GFemi's love letter to all
OL,18,     GGhanaians around the world as the
OL,19,     Gcountry celebrates 69 years of
OL,20,     Gfreedom. Highlighting their
OL,21,     Gbreadth of genres, with a Friday
OL,22,     GVibe from Ghana's M.anifest.
